    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By the 1870s, Atwater had become one of the region's largest grain producers, with wheat farming dominating into the early 1900s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/atwater-16329"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s growth surged when Castle Air Force Base opened in 1941, employing thousands until its 1995 closure.",
